      ******************************************************************
      * PROGRAM-ID:  XFERPROC.cbl
      * SYSTEM:      LEGACY MAINFRAME "MOVE MONEY" PAYMENT RAILS
      * DESCRIPTION: PROCESSES INTERNAL TRANSFERS (BROKERAGE <-> BANK,
      *              RETIREMENT <-> BROKERAGE), ACH, AND WIRE TRANSFERS.
      *              PERFORMS IDEMPOTENCY CHECK, ACCOUNT ACTIVE CHECK,
      *              BALANCE VERIFICATION, WIRE FEE CALCULATION, AND
      *              FRAUD / DAILY LIMIT AUDIT FLAGGING.
      * TABLES:      DB2-ACCT-MASTER, DB2-XFER-LEDGER, DB2-AUDIT-LOG
      * DOWNSTREAM:  MQ-SETTLEMENT-QUEUE (LEGACYSYNC)
      ******************************************************************
       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. XFERPROC.
       AUTHOR. MOVE-MONEY-MAINFRAME-TEAM.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-XFER-REQUEST.
           05 WS-IDEMPOTENCY-KEY       PIC X(36).
           05 WS-TRANSACTION-ID        PIC X(20).
           05 WS-SOURCE-ACCT-NUM       PIC X(12).
           05 WS-TARGET-ACCT-NUM       PIC X(12).
           05 WS-XFER-TYPE             PIC X(10).
      *       VALID TYPES: 'INT-BRKBNK', 'INT-RETBRK', 'ACH', 'WIRE'
           05 WS-XFER-AMOUNT           PIC 9(09)V99 COMP-3.

       01  WS-ACCOUNT-RECORD.
           05 WS-ACCT-ACTIVE-FLAG      PIC X(01).
      *       'Y' = ACTIVE, 'N' = SOFT-DELETED / INACTIVE
           05 WS-AVAILABLE-BALANCE     PIC 9(09)V99 COMP-3.

       01  WS-CALC-FIELDS.
           05 WS-FEE-AMOUNT            PIC 9(05)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.00.
           05 WS-TOTAL-DEBIT           PIC 9(09)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 0.00.
           05 WS-WIRE-FEE-STD          PIC 9(05)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 25.00.
           05 WS-WIRE-FEE-WAIVE-LIMIT  PIC 9(09)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 10000.00.
           05 WS-DAILY-FRAUD-LIMIT     PIC 9(09)V99 COMP-3 VALUE 50000.00.

       01  WS-XFER-RESPONSE.
           05 WS-STATUS-CODE           PIC X(02).
      *       '00' = COMPLETED
      *       '10' = REJECTED - INSUFFICIENT FUNDS
      *       '20' = FLAGGED  - EXCEEDS $50,000 DAILY FRAUD LIMIT
      *       '30' = REJECTED - ACCOUNT INACTIVE (SOFT DELETED)
      *       '90' = DUPLICATE - IDEMPOTENCY KEY ALREADY PROCESSED
           05 WS-STATUS-MESSAGE        PIC X(50).
           05 WS-AUDIT-ACTION          PIC X(20).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-PROCESS.
      *    RULE 1: IDEMPOTENCY CHECK (PREVENT DUPLICATE TRANSACTIONS)
           PERFORM 1000-CHECK-IDEMPOTENCY
           IF WS-STATUS-CODE = '90'
               GOBACK
           END-IF.

      *    RULE 2: DATA PRESERVATION / ACTIVE ACCOUNT CHECK
           IF WS-ACCT-ACTIVE-FLAG NOT = 'Y'
               MOVE '30' TO WS-STATUS-CODE
               MOVE 'REJECTED: SOURCE OR TARGET ACCOUNT INACTIVE'
                 TO WS-STATUS-MESSAGE
               PERFORM 8000-WRITE-IMMUTABLE-AUDIT-LOG
               GOBACK
           END-IF.

      *    RULE 3: FEE SCHEDULE CALCULATION
      *    INTERNAL TRANSFERS ('INT-BRKBNK', 'INT-RETBRK') AND 'ACH' = $0 FEE
      *    'WIRE' TRANSFERS UNDER $10,000.00 INCUR A $25.00 FEE;
      *    'WIRE' TRANSFERS >= $10,000.00 HAVE FEE WAIVED ($0.00).
           MOVE 0.00 TO WS-FEE-AMOUNT
           IF WS-XFER-TYPE = 'WIRE'
               IF WS-XFER-AMOUNT < WS-WIRE-FEE-WAIVE-LIMIT
                   MOVE WS-WIRE-FEE-STD TO WS-FEE-AMOUNT
               END-IF
           END-IF
           COMPUTE WS-TOTAL-DEBIT = WS-XFER-AMOUNT + WS-FEE-AMOUNT.

      *    RULE 4: SUFFICIENT FUNDS CHECK (AMOUNT + APPLICABLE WIRE FEE)
           IF WS-AVAILABLE-BALANCE < WS-TOTAL-DEBIT
               MOVE '10' TO WS-STATUS-CODE
               MOVE 'REJECTED: INSUFFICIENT AVAILABLE BALANCE'
                 TO WS-STATUS-MESSAGE
               PERFORM 8000-WRITE-IMMUTABLE-AUDIT-LOG
               GOBACK
           END-IF.

      *    RULE 5: HIGH-VALUE FRAUD & COMPLIANCE LIMIT ($50,000.00)
           IF WS-XFER-AMOUNT > WS-DAILY-FRAUD-LIMIT
               MOVE '20' TO WS-STATUS-CODE
               MOVE 'FLAGGED: EXCEEDS $50,000 LIMIT - MANUAL REVIEW'
                 TO WS-STATUS-MESSAGE
               PERFORM 8000-WRITE-IMMUTABLE-AUDIT-LOG
               PERFORM 9000-PUBLISH-SETTLEMENT-EVENT
               GOBACK
           END-IF.

      *    RULE 6: EXECUTE ATOMIC DEBIT/CREDIT & PUBLISH EVENT
           COMPUTE WS-AVAILABLE-BALANCE =
               WS-AVAILABLE-BALANCE - WS-TOTAL-DEBIT
           MOVE '00' TO WS-STATUS-CODE
           MOVE 'COMPLETED: TRANSFER PROCESSED SUCCESSFULLY'
             TO WS-STATUS-MESSAGE
           PERFORM 8000-WRITE-IMMUTABLE-AUDIT-LOG
           PERFORM 9000-PUBLISH-SETTLEMENT-EVENT
           GOBACK.
